{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Aedes Elysiae|The millions cycles of Amphoreus, along with the Flame Reaver who was denied the dawn, are about to reach its final curtain. The truth now lies before (Trailblazer), guiding {{MC|ж=her|м=him}} toward the origin point of "Time."}}
